## HOW TO USE THIS SYSTEM

### 1. **Run Locally (Wolfram Desktop)**
```bash
# Save as: AequitasProtocol_Complete.nb
# Open in Wolfram Mathematica Desktop
# Execute: Evaluate > Evaluate Notebook
```

### 2. **Run in Cloud (Wolfram Cloud)**
```
1. Go to: https://www.wolframcloud.com
2. Create free account
3. New Notebook
4. Paste code
5. Evaluate All
```

### 3. **Embed in Website**
```html
<!-- Add to your GitHub Pages -->
<iframe src="https://www.wolframcloud.com/obj/[your-notebook-id]" 
        width="100%" height="800px"></iframe>
```

